Title: Boosted multivariate trees for longitudinal data.
Author: Hemant Ishwaran <hemant.ishwaran@gmail.com>, Udaya B. Kogalur <ubk@kogalur.com>
Maintainer: Udaya B. Kogalur <ubk@kogalur.com>
Depends: R (>= 3.1.0)
Imports: randomForestSRCM, parallel, splines, nlme
Description: Implements Friedman's gradient descent boosting algorithm for longitudinal data using multivariate tree base learners.  A time interaction effect is modeled using B-splines and penalized B-splines (P-splines) with estimated adaptive smoothing parameter.
License: GPL (>=3)
URL: http://web.ccs.miami.edu/~hishwaran    http://www.kogalur.com
